WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.530
Picture a packed football stadium.

2
00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:04.630
One section of the crowd stands up,

3
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:07.850
throws their arms in the
air, and sits back down.

4
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.890
Then the next section does
the same, and the next.

5
00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:14.530
A Mexican wave races all
the way round the ground.

6
00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:18.070
Yet when it's over, every single
person is still in their own

7
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.050
seat.

8
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.930
So what actually travelled
round the stadium?

9
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:26.070
In this mission, you'll find
out what a wave really carries,

10
00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.110
sort waves into transverse
and longitudinal,

11
00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:33.010
and meet amplitude, wavelength,
frequency and period.

12
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:36.900
Your mission: find out what
really travels in a wave.
